.vscode/**
.gitignore
**/*.map
**/.eslintrc.json
node_modules/.bin/**

# Development-only files. They belong in the repository and not in a .vsix: the
# tests drive the client against a real filesystem and cannot run inside an
# installed extension, and install.sh is the OTHER way to install this — shipping
# it inside the thing it installs is a loop that can only confuse.
test-*.js
install.sh
package-lock.json
CLA.md
CONTRIBUTING.md

# Repository plumbing. `vsce ls` is the only thing that shows these — they are
# invisible in the source tree and would otherwise ride along into every .vsix.
.mailmap
.github/**

# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   docs/**   — README.md embeds docs/images/writ-mark-200.png, so the marketplace
#               page loses its mark without it. 44K, and worth it.
#   LICENSE, NOTICE, AUTHORS — AGPL-3.0-or-later; the notices ship with the work.
